<ExperienceLayout
  title="Volunteer Paracanoe Coach"
  company="Calgary Canoe Club"
  period="2020 – 2024"
  location="Calgary, AB"
  tags={["Coaching", "Accessibility", "Athletics", "Volunteering"]}
>
  <p class="text-lg">
    Volunteered as a paracanoe coach for four years, working with athletes across a range 
    of physical disabilities to develop their skills and compete in paddlesport.
  </p>

  <h2>Coaching</h2>
  <p>
    Coached 10+ paracanoe athletes over four years, adapting training programs and equipment 
    to accommodate each individual's abilities and goals. This required creative problem-solving — 
    modifying paddle grips, seat configurations, and training drills to work for each athlete.
  </p>

  <h2>Community Impact</h2>
  <p>
    Supported club events and outreach efforts to promote accessibility and inclusion in 
    paddlesports. Helped demonstrate that adaptive sport is competitive, rewarding, 
    and for everyone.
  </p>
</ExperienceLayout>
